	<name>2400 Bowditch St · North · 750 units · Pre-Application · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 256 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 95 m at radius 111 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (85.3 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
